  "question": {
    "text": "The marks obtained by <math><mn>9</mn></math> students in a chemistry test are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50,69,20,33,53,39,40,65</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>59</mn></math>. If the mean deviation about the median of this data is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "11.4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mn>20,33,39,40,50,53,59,65,69</mn></math><br />Median,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> observation <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> observation <math><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math><br />The absolute values of respective deviations from the median is<br /><math><mn>30,17,11,10,0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3,9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15,19</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>114</mn></math><br />Mean deviation about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>9</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>114</mn></math></p><p>i.e&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>114</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
